    "title": "Driver crashes into North Side USPS post office, prompting temporary shutdown - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Natali Castillo ,\n2 hours ago SAN ANTONIO — A United States Post Office on the North Side is temporarily closed after a driver accidentally crashed their car into the building on Wednesday. A spokesperson with the United States Postal Service said the front lobby area was damaged at the Lockhill Post Office along Huebner road. Read full article\n2",
